---
source: system/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"mountpoint\")"
---
See if a directory or file is a mountpoint

Usage: mountpoint [OPTIONS] <PATH>

Arguments:
  <PATH>  Directory, file, or device to check

Options:
  -d, --fs-devno  Show the major/minor numbers of the device mounted on the given directory
  -q, --quiet     Be quiet - don't print anything
      --nofollow  Do not follow symbolic link if it is the last element of the path
  -x, --devno     Show the major/minor numbers of the given block device
  -h, --help      Print help
  -V, --version   Print version
